# Node System (BC2 / BC3)

- Subclass `Node`; set `metadata: ClassVar[NodeMetadata]` (required).
- Declare `input_ports` / `output_ports`; `Config(NodeConfig)` with `extra="forbid"`.
- Validate constrained config fields with Pydantic validators at construction time.
- SISO: one `input` + one `output` → `process(self, data)` auto-wrapped.
- Capability fields on metadata (`cacheable`, `deterministic`, `streaming_support`, …) default safe; set accurately for MCP/schedulers.
- Register via AutoDiscovery / plugin entry points — do not hand-register in production paths.
- Detail: `.kiro/steering/node-base.md`, `node-registry.md`, `docs/NODE_SYSTEM.md`.
